WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.920
All right, we have very important breaking news&nbsp;
today, and it's it's actually not all bad news.&nbsp;

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:14.320
The coronavirus vaccine from Pfizer and biotech&nbsp;
has been approved for emergency use in the United&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:18.480
Kingdom. And this is a huge deal for a number of&nbsp;
different reasons. Some obvious, some may be less&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:23.920
obvious to people who are planning to get the&nbsp;
vaccine, because you need to understand what's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:29.360
going on in the mind of the anti vaccines in order&nbsp;
to understand some of the relevance here. So I'll&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:34.720
explain it all to you. So first and foremost,&nbsp;
the vaccine approved in the U.K. for emergency&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:41.200
use. This first vaccine is the same vaccine that&nbsp;
was submitted for approval in the United States&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:46.800
made by Pfizer and biotech, German and&nbsp;
American companies. The FDA is meeting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:52.880
next week to decide on emergency use approval&nbsp;
here in the United States as well. In the U.K.,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:59.440
their own agency, the Medicines and Health Care&nbsp;
Products Regulatory Agency, which licenses drugs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:04.480
in the United Kingdom, looked at the trial&nbsp;
data. As you know, the trial data indicates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:11.120
that this vaccine is 95 percent effective at&nbsp;
generating immunity to the coronavirus and said,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:17.360
yes, the data is good, let's start vaccinating&nbsp;
people. Now, it is still going to be labeled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:23.280
experimental until final testing is done.
This is similar to here in the U.S. If the FDA&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:29.600
approves it next week, I believe they are meeting&nbsp;
Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, next week, or maybe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:35.600
right, right around that time in the U.S. it&nbsp;
would be given an emergency use authorization,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:44.000
not a full approval equivalent situation happening&nbsp;
in the U.K. The U.K. now expects 800000 doses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:50.640
within days and they expect people to be receiving&nbsp;
the vaccine really as soon as that happens,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:56.080
potentially Monday in the U.K., they are talking&nbsp;
about this is happening. And it is a really,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:02.640
really big deal. It is the start of and it is&nbsp;
going to be a long tunnel, but we are starting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:08.800
to see the light at the end of the tunnel. Now,&nbsp;
this vaccine different than the Moderna vaccine,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:17.600
the Pfizer biotech vaccine requires storage&nbsp;
at minus 70 degrees Celsius. So it's believed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:22.960
that all of the initial vaccination in the UK is&nbsp;
going to be happening at hospitals that already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:29.440
have or were able to set up the equipment to&nbsp;
store vaccines at that cold temperature. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:34.480
the reasons that this is so important, some&nbsp;
are obvious and some are not so obvious.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:42.640
We need a vaccine and this is a 100 year global&nbsp;
pandemic with what in the US is soon to be a 9/11&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:47.680
a day in terms of deaths. We need a vaccine.&nbsp;
And so this is huge. But the reason that this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:54.400
is also important, specifically because the UK has&nbsp;
done this, is that there are people in the US who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.400 --> 00:03:02.080
are not necessarily anti vaccine in general, but&nbsp;
they're worried about the safety of a vaccine that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:08.480
is simply approved when Donald Trump is president.&nbsp;
The idea being that any agency, including the FDA,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:13.840
could maybe be influenced by Donald Trump&nbsp;
into approving something that should not yet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:20.240
be approved. Now, we've heard from Anthony Fauci&nbsp;
that that's not the case. Once it became clear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:25.840
that despite Donald Trump's pleading in July,&nbsp;
August and September, none of the pharmaceutical&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:31.840
companies developing vaccines pushed for approval&nbsp;
before the election. I was increasingly reassured&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:38.400
that we're not going to see haphazard, rushed&nbsp;
approval requests from pharmaceutical companies.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:44.400
But if you were still worried about that, we&nbsp;
now have a different country's health regulatory&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:52.320
agency that has said this same vaccine is OK to&nbsp;
use. So the point is, if you just don't trust&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:58.080
the FDA under Trump, even if Trump is now a lame&nbsp;
duck and is unlikely to still be pushing them to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:04.080
do anything they shouldn't do, you can say I'm&nbsp;
going to go by the British health regulatory&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:10.240
agencies decision soon. We're expecting the same&nbsp;
thing from the U.S. Health Regulatory Agency. It's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:17.040
the same vaccine, the Pfizer biotech vaccine. And&nbsp;
here in the US as soon as next weekend. I spoke to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:22.960
a doctor recently on the West Coast who said&nbsp;
we have been told expect to get vaccinated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:28.640
maybe next weekend or just a couple of days&nbsp;
after that. This is a major achievement. Pfizer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:34.240
says it can produce 80 million doses this&nbsp;
year, which would be for 40 million people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:39.120
and one point three billion doses next year, which&nbsp;
would be enough for six hundred and fifty million&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:46.720
people. Remembering that you need two doses.&nbsp;
This is needed acutely. The numbers in the US are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:52.560
brutal. We've not yet even seen the impact of&nbsp;
the millions and millions of people who traveled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:58.240
for Thanksgiving to gather indoors and&nbsp;
then travel home. And we still had. Day&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:05.840
two thousand six hundred and fourteen deaths&nbsp;
yesterday, we saw the most deaths in a single day&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:13.600
dating all the way back to April 21st. And&nbsp;
within days, we are expecting to absolutely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:18.800
blow through those numbers. Within a week, we&nbsp;
could see the most deaths in a single day of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:27.040
the entire pandemic. We are very close to&nbsp;
a 9/11 worth of deaths every single day.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:32.560
Now, the ship has sailed on convincing a&nbsp;
huge part of this country about how serious&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:38.640
this is. And the tragedy is that lots of those&nbsp;
same people who refuse to behave responsibly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:43.520
also aren't interested in a vaccine. And we're&nbsp;
going to have to figure out how we deal with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:49.360
that. I don't know the answer. As I spoke about&nbsp;
with Congressman Rokan yesterday, these vaccines&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:55.120
initially will not be given to children. So if you&nbsp;
look at our population, bearing in mind we need&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.120 --> 00:06:01.920
about 70 percent immunity for herd immunity, that&nbsp;
means close to every adult has to be vaccinated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:06.560
for herd immunity. Given that children will&nbsp;
not be eligible for vaccines initially,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:12.560
this is an uphill battle and the tragic irony of&nbsp;
the people demanding everything go back to normal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:17.840
right away, those are the same people refusing to&nbsp;
do the things that would actually help us to get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:23.200
back to normal. So great news from the U.K. We're&nbsp;
keeping an eye on whether we will get a press&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:29.520
conference from the FDA next week announcing their&nbsp;
decision about this same Pfizer biotech vaccine.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:34.560
And we will we will make every effort to cover&nbsp;
that press conference live, if indeed it happens.

